</header>

<main class="container">

<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>
            Every Cup,<br>
            <span class="highlight">a Taste of Moonlight</span>
        </h1>
        <p>Fresh fruit tea · Aromatic coffee · Handcrafted milk tea<br>Find calm in every sip.</p>
        <a href="menu.html" class="hero-btn">
            Explore Menu <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-image">
        <img src="../img/moontea-feature.jpeg" alt="Featured Moon Tea Drink">
    </div>
</section>

<h2 class="section-title">Hot picks</h2>
<div class="card-grid">
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon"><img src="../img/fruittea.png" alt="Fruit Tea"></div>
        <h3>Fruit Tea</h3>
        <p>Fresh-cut fruit × brewed tea – a calming burst of moonlight.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon"><img src="../img/COFFEE.png" alt="Coffee"></div>
        <h3>Brewed Coffee</h3>
        <p>Premium Arabica beans, rich and aromatic to soothe your day.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon"><img src="../img/MILKTEA.png" alt="Milktea"></div>
        <h3>Classic Milk Tea</h3>
        <p>Smooth, creamy, and hand-shaken – comfort in every sip.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon"><img src="../img/SEASONSPECIALS.png" alt="Seasonal Specials"></div>
        <h3>Seasonal Specials</h3>
        <p>New flavours every month – taste the night with us.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="feature-banner">
    <div class="quote">
        <i class="fas fa-quote-left"></i> Sip the Moon, Find Your Calm!
    </div>
    <div class="sub">
        <i class="fas fa-moon" style="color: #6C63FF;"></i> Calm · Cozy · Refreshing
    </div>
</div>

<div class="info-panels">
    <div class="info-panel">
        <div class="panel-image">
            <img src="../img/halal.jpg" alt="Halal Certification">
        </div>
        <div class="panel-content">
            <h4>Halal Certification</h4>
            <p>All drinks certified halal for Muslim consumers.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-panel">
        <div class="panel-image">
            <img src="../img/teagarden.png" alt="Fresh Ingredients">
        </div>
        <div class="panel-content">
            <h4>Fresh Ingredients</h4>
            <p>Direct from orchards, delivered fresh daily.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-panel">
        <div class="panel-image">
            <img src="../img/staff.png" alt="Crafted with Care">
        </div>
        <div class="panel-content">
            <h4>Crafted with Care</h4>
            <p>Every cup filled with moonlight and sincerity.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="reviews-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Customer Reviews</h2>

    <!-- Review Module unchanged (brand-neutral) -->
